            "review_title": "Review at Maruten Sushi-Soba",
            "review_text": "Василий Шляхов\nMoscow, Russia145 contributions\n0\nSushi in Vietnam\nAug 2026 • Couples\nVisited the establishment on the recommendation of other tourists from Russia. They highly recommended tuna sushi and sea grapes. We liked the food. From the rolls we took Alaska - it was original that they had an egg in them. In Russia, you never tried egg rolls. The service is quick and unobtrusive. There is free Wi-Fi - you can call a taxi after lunch or dinner.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten August 10, 2026",
