            "review_title": "Review at Maruten Sushi-Soba",
            "review_text": "lillecupcakes\nLille, France74 contributions\n0\nSurprised at the bill...\nAug 2026 • Family\nI give three stars because although we enjoyed the dishes (a variety of sushi, maki, sashimi and tempura) we did not appreciate that the prices displayed on the menu are not the prices you pay in the end... they add 8% for drinks and 10% on dishes... mind-boggling and never seen anywhere else in Vietnam... plus a few small intestinal problems afterwards... so I am also asking the question about the freshness of the products\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten August 7, 2026",
